      "filename": "I was surprised to see no lightning conductor above the dome (38221673934).jpg",
      "title": "File:I was surprised to see no lightning conductor above the dome (38221673934).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/50/I_was_surprised_to_see_no_lightning_conductor_above_the_dome_%2838221673934%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:I_was_surprised_to_see_no_lightning_conductor_above_the_dome_(38221673934).jpg",
      "width": 6000,
      "height": 4000,
