      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "An overall view of the Amritsar Town Hall from its large forecourt. The buses are probably for Government officials. I had taken the previous picture of the Hall Bazaar gate through that large arch you see up ahead. (though not from this far- we were closer then). The Amritsar Town Hall now houses the totally absorbing and poignant Partition Museum- we will talk about that later in this album. (see subsequent pictures) (Amritsar, Punjab, northern India, Nov. 2017)",
